    ["AINpcWeatherTasteDec_20"]="灾祸的传说、可怕的预兆",
    ["AINpcWeatherTasteDec_21"]="可怕的、灾难、巴风特",
    ["AINpcWeatherTasteDec_22"]="炎热、喘不过气、汗水",
    ["AINpcWeatherTaste_01"]="喜欢黎光",
    ["AINpcWeatherTaste_02"]="不喜欢黎光",
