    ["OXExam_Question030"]="<color=#F2C730FF>短剑</color>可对<color=#F2C730FF>大、中型魔物</color>造成100%的伤害,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
