    ["OXExam_Question036"]="<color=#F2C730FF>弓箭</color>可对<color=#F2C730FF>中、小型魔物</color>造成100%的伤害,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXExam_Question037"]="<color=#F2C730FF>弓箭</color>可对<color=#F2C730FF>大型魔物</color>造成100%的伤害,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
