    ["OXExam_Question117_1"]="鲨鱼是胎生的",
    ["OXExam_Question118"]="<color=#F2C730FF>云</color>和<color=#F2C730FF>雾</color>本质上相同的物质,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXExam_Question119"]="斐扬的柯柯因为挑食导致夜盲症,原因是缺少维生素B,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXExam_Question119_1"]="夜盲症是因为缺少维生素A导致的",
    ["OXExam_Question120"]="斐扬的柯柯睡觉的时候会磨牙,原因是缺少锌的摄入,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXExam_Question121"]="依斯鲁得岛海边<color=#F2C730FF>夏季</color>的时候经常会出现<color=#F2C730FF>海市蜃楼</color>,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXExam_Question122"]="<color=#F2C730FF>魔法攻击</color>造成的伤害会受到<color=#F2C730FF>目标体型</color>的影响，对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXExam_Question122_1"]="魔法攻击造成的伤害不受体型影响",
    ["OXExam_Question123"]="<color=#F2C730FF>同级别</color>的小中大三种体型的怪物血量和经验按比例<color=#F2C730FF>递增</color>，对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXExam_Question124"]="<color=#F2C730FF>毒属性</color>攻击对<color=#F2C730FF>所有属性</color>都能提高伤害，对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXExam_Question124_1"]="毒属性攻击只对部分属性提高伤害",
    ["OXExam_Question125"]="<color=#F2C730FF>攻速</color>和<color=#F2C730FF>最终攻速</color>不是同一个属性，对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXExam_Question126"]="<color=#F2C730FF>暴击</color>和<color=#F2C730FF>最终暴击</color>是同一个属性，对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXExam_Question126_1"]="暴击和最终暴击不是同一个属性",
    ["OXExam_Question127"]="<color=#F2C730FF>闪避</color>和<color=#F2C730FF>最终闪避</color>是同一个属性，对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXExam_Question127_1"]="闪避和最终闪避不是同一个属性",
    ["OXExam_Question128"]="使用<color=#F2C730FF>涂毒</color>后普攻属性变为<color=#F2C730FF>毒属性</color>，对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXExam_Question128_1"]="使用致命涂毒后普攻属性变为毒属性",
    ["OXExam_Question129"]="使用<color=#F2C730FF>怒爆</color>后普攻属性变为<color=#F2C730FF>火属性</color>，对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXExam_Question130"]="使用<color=#F2C730FF>撒水祈福</color>后目标的普攻属性变为<color=#F2C730FF>圣属性</color>，对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXExam_Question131"]="只有<color=#F2C730FF>商人</color>才能开启<color=#F2C730FF>露天商店</color>，对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXExam_Question131_1"]="带有经商词缀的宠物都可以开启露天商店",
    ["OXExam_Question132"]="每天的<color=#F2C730FF>12</color>点和<color=#F2C730FF>20</color>点在<color=#F2C730FF>普隆德拉</color>可提高获取<color=#F2C730FF>奥丁祝福</color>点数的速度，对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXExam_Question133"]="通过提高<color=#F2C730FF>急速</color>可以减免技能的<color=#F2C730FF>可变吟唱</color>时间，对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXExam_Question134"]="<color=#F2C730FF>MVP</color>和<color=#F2C730FF>Mini</color>的<color=#F2C730FF>重生时间</color>是一致的，对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXExam_Question134_1"]="MVP和Mini的重生时间不是一致的",
    ["OXExam_Question135"]="在<color=#F2C730FF>露天商店</color>寻找要购买的货物只能<color=#F2C730FF>每一家店</color>打开寻找,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXExam_Question135_1"]="可以使用杂货店出售的摆摊雷达快速寻找",
    ["OXExam_Question136"]="交易行内以<color=#F2C730FF>钻石</color>价格出售的物品成功售出后可获得扣除交易税后的钻石数对应的<color=#F2C730FF>等量水晶</color>,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXExam_Question137"]="蚁后开启<color=#F2C730FF>防御姿态</color>后<color=#F2C730FF>远程职业</color>应该<color=#F2C730FF>加强输出</color>来打破护盾,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXExam_Question137_1"]="远程职业应该远离",
    ["OXExam_Question138"]="听说<color=#F2C730FF>僵尸</color>与<color=#F2C730FF>妖道</color>在尚未化作魔物之前,曾是一对恩爱的<color=#F2C730FF>眷侣</color>,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXExam_Question138_1"]="僵尸与妖道是兄妹",
    ["OXExam_Question139"]="<color=#F2C730FF>普隆德拉南门</color>外的<color=#F2C730FF>父女</color>,其实并<color=#F2C730FF>没有</color>血缘关系,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXExam_Question140"]="在米德加尔特大陆上,一共生活着<color=#F2C730FF>9</color>种不同种类的<color=#F2C730FF>波利</color>,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXExam_Question140_1"]="一共有7种波利",
    ["OXExam_Question141"]="卡普拉公司的<color=#F2C730FF>总部</color>位于运河之都·<color=#F2C730FF>艾尔贝塔</color>,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXExam_Question141_1"]="位于边境之都-艾尔帕兰",
    ["OXExam_Question142"]="边境之都·<color=#F2C730FF>梦罗克</color>拥有高度发达的<color=#F2C730FF>棉花工业</color>,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXExam_Question143"]="目前米德加尔特大陆的<color=#F2C730FF>面具哥布灵</color>共有<color=#F2C730FF>9</color>种不同的类型,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXExam_Question143_1"]="一共有8种面具哥布尔",
    ["OXExam_Question144"]="进入<color=#F2C730FF>黑夜</color>之后,<color=#F2C730FF>流浪之狼</color>将会变得更加强大,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXExam_Question145"]="<color=#F2C730FF>蓝疯兔</color>最喜欢<color=#F2C730FF>榴莲草</color>的气味,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXExam_Question146"]="<color=#F2C730FF>巴风特</color>所佩戴的饰品名为“<color=#F2C730FF>恶魔之戒</color>”,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXExam_Question147"]="传说<color=#F2C730FF>梦魇</color>的眼睛,拥有<color=#F2C730FF>看透人心</color>的力量,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXExam_Question148"]="MINI<color=#F2C730FF>恶魔波利</color>是<color=#F2C730FF>大型</color>魔物,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXExam_Question148_1"]="恶魔波利是中型怪",
    ["OXExam_Question149"]="刺客在使用<color=#F2C730FF>翻滚</color>或<color=#F2C730FF>隐匿</color>技能后,都会进入<color=#F2C730FF>隐匿</color>状态,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXExam_Question150"]="仙境传说是由<color=#F2C730FF>漫画</color>改编的游戏,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXExam_Question151"]="<color=#F2C730FF>波利</color>最喜欢的食物是<color=#F2C730FF>苹果汁</color>,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXExam_Question152"]="“<color=#F2C730FF>老旧卷轴</color>”和“<color=#F2C730FF>酒精</color>”都是<color=#F2C730FF>不死系</color>魔物掉落的道具,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXExam_Question152_1"]="恶魔系魔物掉落",
    ["OXExam_Question153"]="使用<color=#F2C730FF>血迹树枝</color>召唤的MVP/MINI魔物,最多只能存在<color=#F2C730FF>1小时</color>,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXExam_Question154"]="海盗之王的<color=#F2C730FF>乌鸦</color>总是站在他的<color=#F2C730FF>左肩</color>上,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXExam_Question155"]="<color=#F2C730FF>吉芬</color>是<color=#F2C730FF>魔法公会</color>的驻地,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXExam_Question156"]="<color=#F2C730FF>碎晶蘑菇</color>并非只出现于夜晚,在<color=#F2C730FF>晴朗</color>的<color=#F2C730FF>白天</color>也可以采集到,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXExam_Question156_1"]="只有清晨或傍晚可以",
    ["OXExam_Question157"]="参与<color=#F2C730FF>公会KVM</color>时,同阵营的队伍成员可以来自于<color=#F2C730FF>不同公会</color>,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXExam_Question157_1"]="不可以有非本公会成员",
    ["OXExam_Question158"]="在<color=#F2C730FF>海底洞穴</color>中一共可以钓到<color=#F2C730FF>6</color>种不同的鱼类,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXExam_Question159"]="<color=#F2C730FF>忽克连</color>展示他的二头肌时,总喜欢先高举<color=#F2C730FF>双手</color>,再举起<color=#F2C730FF>右手</color>,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXExam_Question159_1"]="先高举双手再举起左手",
    ["OXExam_Question160"]="斐扬的<color=#F2C730FF>锦莲池</color>中盛开着<color=#F2C730FF>三朵</color>莲花,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXExam_Question161"]="<color=#F2C730FF>W</color>被称为卡普拉的<color=#F2C730FF>人气女王</color>,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXExam_Question162"]="在酒馆的<color=#F2C730FF>掰手腕</color>小游戏中,大家总是习惯使用<color=#F2C730FF>左手</color>,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXExam_Question162_1"]="掰手腕使用右手",
    ["OXExam_Question163"]="<color=#F2C730FF>月夜猫</color>拥有漂亮的<color=#F2C730FF>红色</color>瞳孔,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXExam_Question164"]="<color=#F2C730FF>大脚龙虾</color>身上的红色斑纹是被<color=#F2C730FF>高温蒸煮</color>后留下的痕迹,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXExam_Question165"]="被皮里恩的<color=#F2C730FF>酸雨</color>攻击命中时,可以使用<color=#F2C730FF>万能药</color>解除负面状态,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXExam_Question166"]="<color=#F2C730FF>拳刃</color>可对<color=#F2C730FF>中、小型魔物</color>造成100%的伤害,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？ ",
    ["OXExam_Question166_1"]="可对中型魔物造成100%伤害",
    ["OXExam_Question167"]="<color=#F2C730FF>野外挂机</color>时，组队人数与加成系数成正比，对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？ ",
    ["OXExam_Question168"]="<color=#F2C730FF>橙色品质装备</color>的获取途径为：MVP、MINI、交易行、装备扭蛋机，对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？ ",
    ["OXExam_Question169"]="技能界面中，显示为<color=#F2C730FF>圆形</color>的技能图标均为主动技能，对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？ ",
    ["OXExam_Question170"]="技能界面中，显示为<color=#F2C730FF>正方形</color>的技能图标均为被动技能，对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？ ",
    ["OXExam_Question171"]="技能界面中Auto设置时，<color=#F2C730FF>主动技能</color>无法调整释放等级，对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？ ",
    ["OXExam_Question171_1"]="在Auto设置中主动技能可调节释放等级",
    ["OXExam_Question172"]="艾尔贝塔的<color=#F2C730FF>水晶商店</color>可购买【技能重置棒】来重置技能点数，对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？ ",
    ["OXExam_Question173"]="艾尔贝塔的<color=#F2C730FF>水晶商店</color>可购买【轮回之石】来重置属性加点，对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？ ",
    ["OXExam_Question174"]="<color=#F2C730FF>【王牌争霸赛】</color>是一个公平的竞技玩法，对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？ ",
    ["OXExam_Question175"]="参与<color=#F2C730FF>【王牌争霸赛】</color>活动可获得大量<color=#F2C730FF>影装</color>升级材料，对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？ ",
    ["OXExam_Question176"]="宠物<color=#F2C730FF>溜溜猴</color>最喜欢的水果是树葡萄，对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？ ",
    ["OXExam_Question177"]="宠物<color=#F2C730FF>沙漠幼狼</color>喜欢的食物是家畜血，对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？ ",
    ["OXExam_Question177_1"]="沙漠幼狼喜欢的食物是牲畜血",
    ["OXExam_Question178"]="<color=#F2C730FF>奥丁的祝福</color>只可对自身等级差在3级的内的魔物生效，对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？ ",
    ["OXExam_Question178_1"]="可对6级内的魔物生效",
    ["OXExam_Question179"]="<color=#F2C730FF>奥丁的祝福</color>只能通过完成每日委托获得，对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？ ",
    ["OXExam_Question179_1"]="可通过完成每日委托和普隆德拉场景挂机获取",
    ["OXExam_Question180"]="参与<color=#F2C730FF>酒馆小游戏</color>可获得<color=#F2C730FF>活力药水</color>，对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？ ",
    ["OXExam_Question181"]="<color=#F2C730FF>卡普拉服务人员</color>可以将你传送到你还未去过的城市，对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？ ",
    ["OXExam_Question182"]="<color=#F2C730FF>抓捕宠物</color>时，魔物血量越低，成功率越高，对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？ ",
    ["OXExam_Question183"]="<color=#F2C730FF>奥丁祝福</color>提供的额外奖励中，魔物的道具掉落不受等级衰减的限制，对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？ ",
    ["OXExam_Question184"]="普通状态下<color=#F2C730FF>击杀魔物</color>，魔物的掉落受到到等级衰减的限制，对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？ ",
    ["OXExam_Question185"]="游戏中可通过购买<color=#F2C730FF>角色改名卡</color>更改自己的角色名称，对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？ ",
    ["OXExam_Question186"]="游戏中可通过与NPC提升亲密度解锁更高的附魔等级，对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？ ",
    ["OXExam_Question187"]="游戏中只有异性才能结成情侣，对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？ ",
    ["OXExam_Question187_1"]="都可以",
    ["OXExam_Question188"]="游戏中【自动钓竿】可通过【鱼拓纪念币】兑换，对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？ ",
    ["OXExam_Question189"]="牧师技能【光耀之堂】可对不死系与恶魔系魔物造成伤害，对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？ ",
    ["OXExam_Question190"]="【嘉年华】中的进度宝箱一共有4个，对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？ ",
    ["OXExam_Question190_1"]="一共有5个",
    ["OXExam_Question191"]="只有【剑士系】可骑乘战斗坐骑进行攻击，对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？ ",
    ["OXExam_Question191_1"]="剑士系和游侠都可以",
    ["OXExam_Question192"]="仰头点眼药水时微微张嘴，这样眼睛就不容易乱眨了，对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？ ",
    ["OXExam_Question193"]="眼睛进了小灰尘，闭上眼睛用力咳嗽几下，灰尘就会自己出来了，对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？ ",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion001"]=" 中秋节源于<color=#F2C730FF>天象崇拜</color>,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion002"]="中秋节最早记载于<color=#F2C730FF>《周礼》</color>,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion003"]="中秋节在<color=#F2C730FF>隋朝</color>成为官方认定的全国性节日。,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion003_1"]="在唐朝成为官方认定的全国性节日",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion004"]="“小饼如嚼月，中有酥和饴”说的是<color=#F2C730FF>月饼</color>,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion005"]="中秋具有团圆的意象，是从<color=#F2C730FF>北宋</color>开始的,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion005_1"]="是从明清开始的",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion006"]="除了祭月外，<color=#F2C730FF>桂花</color>也是中秋的一大重点,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion007"]="中秋节有<color=#F2C730FF>燃灯船</color>的习俗,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion008"]="所谓“追月”是在中秋后<color=#F2C730FF>一周</color>继续邀客赏月,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion008_1"]="“追月”是在中秋次日继续赏月的习俗",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion009"]="中秋节也有<color=#F2C730FF>灯谜</color>的习俗,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion010"]="在中国东南方，中秋时也有<color=#F2C730FF>观潮</color>的习俗,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion011"]="中秋时，扎纸灯用高杆竖起来的习俗是<color=#F2C730FF>灯谜</color>,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion011_1"]="这个习俗名叫竖中秋",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion012"]="“耍碌仔”是一种专属于<color=#F2C730FF>成人</color>的习俗,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion012_1"]="耍碌仔是专属于小孩的活动",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion013"]="中秋节有花灯，且与元宵节<color=#F2C730FF>规模相同</color>,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion013_1"]="中秋节的花灯比元宵节规模小得多",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion014"]="<color=#F2C730FF>舞火龙</color>也是中秋节的习俗之一,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion015"]="“听香”是指烧香后<color=#F2C730FF>获取神的指示</color>，以此实现愿望,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion015_1"]="“听香”是指在烧香提问之后听到的第一句话，就是天神对问题的答案",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion016"]="“烧塔”习俗指的是为庆祝中秋<color=#F2C730FF>点燃高塔</color>,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion016_1"]="“烧塔”是指点燃制成宝塔形状的灯",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion017"]="兔儿爷的原型是月宫中的<color=#F2C730FF>玉兔</color>,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion018"]="明代时，中秋节宫廷<color=#F2C730FF>兴吃螃蟹</color>,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion019"]="“男不圆月，女不祭灶”是说<color=#F2C730FF>男子不庆祝中秋</color>,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion020"]="中秋玩兔儿爷的习俗起源于<color=#F2C730FF>清初</color>,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion020_1"]="这个习俗起源于明末",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion021"]="中国江南一带，中秋时出街游市的活动叫<color=#F2C730FF>“走月”</color>,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion022"]="中秋时，儿童在柚子上插香舞动，被称为“舞流星香球”的活动源于<color=#F2C730FF>中国北方</color>,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion022_1"]="“舞流星香球”的习俗源于四川",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion023"]="源自闽南的中秋习俗“博饼”是一种<color=#F2C730FF>骰子游戏</color>,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion024"]="“青苗社”是中国北方祭拜<color=#F2C730FF>月亮</color>的活动,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion024_1"]="“青苗社”是祭拜土谷神的活动",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion025"]="在<color=#F2C730FF>河北</color>某些地方，中秋也被称作“小元旦”,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion026"]="蒙古族人会有<color=#F2C730FF>“追月”</color>的习俗，有骑手会直追到月亮西下,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion027"]="藏族“寻月”的中秋习俗，和月亮在<color=#F2C730FF>水中的倒影</color>有关,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion028"]="广西侗族的“行月”习俗是<color=#F2C730FF>骑马赏月</color>,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion028_1"]="“行月”是结成歌舞队踏月而歌的习俗",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion029"]="“串月”是云南少数民族<color=#F2C730FF>串门走亲戚</color>的中秋习俗,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion029_1"]="“串月”是供青年男女互结良缘的习俗",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion030"]="<color=#F2C730FF>“跳月”</color>是云南彝族在月光下载歌载舞的习俗,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion031"]="“虎日”是仡佬族对<color=#F2C730FF>中秋</color>的称呼，这天他们会宰杀公牛,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion031_1"]="“虎日”是中秋前几日",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion032"]="朝鲜族中秋时会搭建“望月架”以供<color=#F2C730FF>孩童</color>望月,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion032_1"]="望月架是供老人望月的",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion033"]="<color=#F2C730FF>壮族</color>中秋时节兴请月神的习俗,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion034"]="壮族请月神习俗中，需要<color=#F2C730FF>男子</color>作为代言人,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion034_1"]="代言人应当是女子",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion035"]="壮族请月神习俗中，人们都<color=#F2C730FF>聆听</color>月神代言人歌唱,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion035_1"]="请月神时，应当人神对唱，不是单方面聆听",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion036"]="壮族请月神习俗中，最后<color=#F2C730FF>不用</color>请月神回天,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion036_1"]="请月神仪式结束后，需要请神回天",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion037"]="<color=#F2C730FF>黎族</color>中秋节成为“八月会”或“调声节”,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion038"]="黎族“调声节”活动中，领头的青年男女称为<color=#F2C730FF>“调声头”</color>,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion039"]="黎族的“八月会”中，<color=#F2C730FF>没有</color>食用月饼的习俗,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion039_1"]="黎族中秋是有食用月饼的习俗的",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion040"]="在韩国，中秋又有<color=#F2C730FF>“嘉俳日”</color>之名,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion041"]="英文中韩国中秋节为<color=#F2C730FF>“韩国感恩节”</color>,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion042"]="越南的中秋节是为了纪念传说中的<color=#F2C730FF>阿贵飞仙</color>,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion043"]="越南传说中的阿贵是一个<color=#F2C730FF>医术高明的医神</color>,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion043_1"]="阿贵治病用的是菩提树，不是自己的医术",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion044"]="越南传说中的阿贵，是<color=#F2C730FF>自行</color>登上月宫的,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion044_1"]="是菩提树带他飞天登月的",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion045"]="越南中秋的活动有<color=#F2C730FF>较多与动物</color>有关，如舞狮、鲤鱼灯,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion046"]="日本的中秋节又称<color=#F2C730FF>十五夜</color>,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion047"]="日本的中秋节又称<color=#F2C730FF>芋明月</color>,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion048"]="日本的中秋以<color=#F2C730FF>吃月饼</color>为习俗,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion048_1"]="日本中秋兴吃月见团子",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion049"]="日本的赏月活动称为<color=#F2C730FF>“月见”</color>,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion050"]="日本中秋节赏月时，会在<color=#F2C730FF>屋内</color>陈列团子、芒草等物品,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion051"]="中秋节对<color=#F2C730FF>马来西亚</color>来说是非常重要的节日,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion052"]="嫦娥吃仙药飞升是这个故事的<color=#F2C730FF>最原初</color>版本,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion052_1"]="嫦娥吃仙药飞升是经由传播改编后的故事版本",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion053"]="玉兔捣药最早见于屈原<color=#F2C730FF>《天问》</color>,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion054"]="传说中，玉兔就是<color=#F2C730FF>嫦娥</color>所养的兔子，飞升时也同样带上了月宫,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion055"]="在任何神话中，玉兔都是在捣制<color=#F2C730FF>长生不老药</color>,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion055_1"]="日本传说中玉兔是在做年糕",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion056"]="著名乐曲<color=#F2C730FF>《霓裳羽衣曲》</color>与唐玄宗梦游月宫有关,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion057"]="月饼曾在<color=#F2C730FF>元代</color>为起义传递情报,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion058"]="歇后语八月十五的月亮——<color=#F2C730FF>磊落</color>,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion058_1"]="八月十五的月亮——正大",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion059"]="歇后语八月十五吃年糕——<color=#F2C730FF>正好</color>,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion059_1"]="八月十五吃年糕——还早",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion060"]="歇后语八月十五看灯笼——<color=#F2C730FF>差不离</color>,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion060_1"]="八月十五看灯笼——迟了大半年",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion061"]="歇后语八月十五过年——<color=#F2C730FF>提前</color>,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion061_1"]="八月十五过年——差了节气",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion062"]="有些地方中秋有偷吃习俗，<color=#F2C730FF>抓到偷吃的人</color>越多，主人越高兴,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion062_1"]="中秋偷吃的习俗中，偷吃的越多，主人越高兴",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion063"]="播撒蜡液庆祝的煲蜡，<color=#F2C730FF>现在</color>还是著名的中秋习俗,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion063_1"]="煲蜡早在上世纪被禁绝，因为有安全隐患",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion064"]="朝鲜半岛的秋夕除了庆祝秋收，还有<color=#F2C730FF>庆祝战胜渤海国</color>之意,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion065"]="强羌水越来，是一种庆祝<color=#F2C730FF>端午节</color>的民族舞蹈,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion065_1"]="强羌水越来是庆祝中秋节的舞蹈",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion066"]="除了中秋节之外，“月见”也可指<color=#F2C730FF>九月十三日</color>的夜晚,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion067"]="中秋又有<color=#F2C730FF>“月光诞”</color>之别称,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion068"]="<color=#F2C730FF>乞月</color>为单身男女为求良缘，向月老祭拜的习俗,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion069"]="观潮也是中秋一大习俗，主要集中在<color=#F2C730FF>北方沿海</color>,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion069_1"]="观潮习俗主要集中在浙江一带",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion070"]="照月为<color=#F2C730FF>单身女子</color>祈求姻缘，夜间沐浴月光的习俗,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion070_1"]="“照月”为已婚妇女求子的习俗",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion071"]="烧斗香是<color=#F2C730FF>中国江苏</color>的中秋习俗,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion072"]="<color=#F2C730FF>“偷月亮菜”</color>是一种中秋习俗，年轻女子趁夜色偷菜，意图求段好姻缘,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion073"]="抛帕招亲源于中国福建地区，让未婚姑娘<color=#F2C730FF>扮嫦娥</color>，抛手帕招亲,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion074"]="吴刚是<color=#F2C730FF>本来</color>就住在月亮上，砍伐桂树为生的,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion074_1"]="吴刚是被罚上月宫的",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion075"]="<color=#F2C730FF>“打月亮”</color>是土族习俗，人们舀水映月，并用石头击打倒影,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion076"]="兔爷就是<color=#F2C730FF>玉兔</color>,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion077"]="中秋舞龙源于<color=#F2C730FF>蟒蛇</color>作害的传说,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion078"]="兔爷受嫦娥所托降世治病，<color=#F2C730FF>并收取酬劳</color>,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion078_1"]="兔爷不要酬劳，只借衣服穿",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion079"]="中秋节烧塔的习俗，源于旧时<color=#F2C730FF>农民起义</color>,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion080"]="琉球中秋时，<color=#F2C730FF>人吃月饼，而用吹上饼作祭品</color>,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion080_1"]="二者都可作食物和祭品",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion081"]="中秋不仅祭拜月亮，还祭拜土地，属于一种<color=#F2C730FF>丰收节</color>,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion082"]="八月十五种麦——<color=#F2C730FF>赶忙</color>,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion082_1"]="八月十五种麦——太早了",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion083"]="中秋的天气——<color=#F2C730FF>温和宜人</color>,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion083_1"]="中秋的天气——不冷不热",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion084"]="八月十五套年磨——<color=#F2C730FF>不讲理</color>,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion084_1"]="八月十五套年磨——早点",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion085"]="八月十五吃饺子——<color=#F2C730FF>离谱</color>,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion085_1"]="八月十五吃饺子——破了规矩",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion086"]="八月十五打兔子——<color=#F2C730FF>造反</color>,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion086_1"]="八月十五打兔子——差远了",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion087"]="八月十五种花生——<color=#F2C730FF>正当时</color>,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion087_1"]="八月十五种花生——瞎指挥",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion088"]="站在河岸捞月亮——<color=#F2C730FF>努力</color>,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion088_1"]="站在河岸捞月亮——白搭",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion089"]="月亮追太阳——<color=#F2C730FF>不能</color>,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion089_1"]="月亮追太阳——老不碰头",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion090"]="八月十五云遮月——<color=#F2C730FF>黑灯瞎火</color>,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion090_1"]="八月十五云遮月——扫兴",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion091"]="八月十五面朝火——<color=#F2C730FF>心慌</color>,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion091_1"]="八月十五面朝火——渐渐冷了",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion092"]="八月十五种豆子——<color=#F2C730FF>赶忙</color>,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion092_1"]="八月十五种豆子——晚了三秋",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion093"]="八月十五团圆饼——<color=#F2C730FF>分享</color>,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion093_1"]="八月十五团圆饼——不给外人",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion094"]="嫦娥用剪刀——<color=#F2C730FF>绝情</color>,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion094_1"]="嫦娥用剪刀——高裁（才）",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion095"]="竹竿打月亮——<color=#F2C730FF>好胆色</color>,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion095_1"]="竹竿打月亮——挨不上",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion096"]="太阳和月亮讲话——<color=#F2C730FF>大喇叭</color>,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion096_1"]="太阳和月亮讲话——空谈",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion097"]="疯狗咬月亮——<color=#F2C730FF>胃口大</color>,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion097_1"]="疯狗咬月亮——狂汪（妄）",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion098"]="秃子追月亮——<color=#F2C730FF>同类相吸</color>,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion098_1"]="秃子追月亮——沾光",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion099"]="月亮下点灯——<color=#F2C730FF>互相借光</color>,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion099_1"]="月亮下点灯——多此一举",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion100"]="月亮下面耍弯刀——<color=#F2C730FF>耀武扬威</color>,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion100_1"]="明砍",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion101"]=" 中秋节源于<color=#F2C730FF>人物崇拜</color>,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion101_1"]="中秋节源于天象崇拜",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion102"]="中秋节最早记载于<color=#F2C730FF>《左传》</color>,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion102_1"]="中秋最早记载于《周礼》",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion103"]="中秋节在<color=#F2C730FF>唐朝</color>成为官方认定的全国性节日。对(O)或错(X)？,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion104"]="“小饼如嚼月，中有酥和饴”说的是<color=#F2C730FF>粽子</color>,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion104_1"]="“小饼如嚼月，中有酥和饴”说的是月饼",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion105"]="中秋具有团圆的意象，是从<color=#F2C730FF>明清</color>开始的,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion106"]="除了祭月外，<color=#F2C730FF>桃花</color>也是中秋的一大重点,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion106_1"]="桂花是中秋节除祭月之外的重点",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion107"]="中秋节<color=#F2C730FF>从无</color>燃灯船的习俗,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion107_1"]="中秋节是有燃灯船的习俗的",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion108"]="所谓“追月”是在中秋后<color=#F2C730FF>次日</color>继续邀客赏月,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion109"]="中秋节<color=#F2C730FF>没有</color>灯谜的习俗,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion109_1"]="中秋节是存在猜灯谜的习俗的",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion110"]="在中国<color=#F2C730FF>西北方</color>，中秋时也有观潮的习俗,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion110_1"]="在中国东南方，中秋时也有观潮的习俗",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion111"]="中秋时，扎纸灯用高杆竖起来的习俗称作<color=#F2C730FF>竖中秋</color>,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion112"]="“耍碌仔”是一种专属于<color=#F2C730FF>儿童</color>的习俗,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion113"]="中秋节有花灯，但<color=#F2C730FF>规模比元宵节小很多</color>,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion114"]="舞火龙<color=#F2C730FF>不是</color>中秋节的习俗之一,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion114_1"]="东南地方有中秋节舞火龙的习俗",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion115"]="“听香”是指<color=#F2C730FF>烧香时提问</color>，之后听到的第一句话，就是问题的答案,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion116"]="“烧塔”习俗指的是为庆祝中秋点燃<color=#F2C730FF>高塔形状的灯</color>,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion117"]="兔儿爷的原型是月宫中的<color=#F2C730FF>嫦娥</color>,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion117_1"]="兔儿爷的原型是玉兔",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion118"]="明代时，中秋节宫廷<color=#F2C730FF>禁吃螃蟹</color>,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion118_1"]="明代时，中秋节宫廷兴吃螃蟹",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion119"]="“男不圆月，女不祭灶”是说<color=#F2C730FF>女子</color>不庆祝中秋,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion119_1"]="“男不圆月，女不祭灶”是说男子不过中秋",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion120"]="中秋玩兔儿爷的习俗起源于<color=#F2C730FF>明末</color>,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion121"]="中国江南一带，中秋时出街游市的活动叫<color=#F2C730FF>“追月”</color>,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion121_1"]="这个习俗名叫走月",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion122"]="中秋时，儿童在柚子上插香舞动，被称为“舞流星香球”的活动源于<color=#F2C730FF>中国四川</color>,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion123"]="源自闽南的中秋习俗“博饼”是一种<color=#F2C730FF>纸牌游戏</color>,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion123_1"]="博饼是骰子游戏",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion124"]="“青苗社”是中国北方祭拜<color=#F2C730FF>土谷神</color>的活动,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion125"]="在河北某些地方，中秋也被称作<color=#F2C730FF>“大元旦”</color>,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion125_1"]="河北某些地方称中秋叫“小元旦”",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion126"]="<color=#F2C730FF>维吾尔族</color>人会有“追月”的习俗，有骑手会直追到月亮西下,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion126_1"]="蒙古族人才有追月习俗",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion127"]="藏族“寻月”的中秋习俗，和<color=#F2C730FF>月亮在天空的形状</color>有关,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion127_1"]="中秋节“寻月”的习俗和水中的月影有关",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion128"]="广西侗族的“行月”习俗是<color=#F2C730FF>结成歌舞队</color>踏月而歌,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion129"]="“串月”是云南少数民族<color=#F2C730FF>供青年男女</color>互结良缘的中秋习俗,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion130"]="“跳月”是<color=#F2C730FF>朝鲜族</color>在月光下载歌载舞的习俗,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion130_1"]="“跳月”是彝族的习俗",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion131"]="“虎日”是仡佬族对<color=#F2C730FF>中秋之前几天</color>的称呼，这天他们会宰杀公牛为中秋做准备,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion132"]="朝鲜族中秋时会搭建“望月架”以供<color=#F2C730FF>老人</color>望月,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion133"]="壮族中秋时节兴请<color=#F2C730FF>日神</color>的习俗,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion133_1"]="壮族中秋节兴请月神",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion134"]="壮族请月神习俗中，需要<color=#F2C730FF>女子</color>作为代言人,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion135"]="壮族请月神习俗中，人们与月神代言人<color=#F2C730FF>对唱</color>,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion136"]="壮族请月神习俗中，最后<color=#F2C730FF>需要</color>请月神回天,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion137"]="<color=#F2C730FF>壮族</color>中秋节称为“八月会”或“调声节”,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion137_1"]="这两个别称是黎族的叫法",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion138"]="黎族“调声节”活动中，领头的<color=#F2C730FF>老年男女</color>称为“调声头”,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion138_1"]="“调声节”活动中，领头的“调声头“是青年男女",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion139"]="黎族的“八月会”中，也有<color=#F2C730FF>食用月饼</color>的习俗,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion140"]="在<color=#F2C730FF>日本</color>，中秋又有“嘉俳日”之名,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion140_1"]="“嘉俳日”是韩国对中秋的叫法",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion141"]="英文中韩国中秋节为<color=#F2C730FF>“韩国复活节”</color>,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion141_1"]="英文中韩国中秋节叫“韩国感恩节”",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion142"]="<color=#F2C730FF>菲律宾</color>的中秋节是为了纪念传说中的阿贵飞仙,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion142_1"]="越南的中秋节是纪念阿贵飞仙的",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion143"]="越南传说中的阿贵用<color=#F2C730FF>菩提树</color>为人治病,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion144"]="越南传说中的阿贵，是<color=#F2C730FF>菩提树</color>带他飞上月宫的,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion145"]="<color=#F2C730FF>日本</color>中秋的活动有较多与动物有关，如舞狮、鲤鱼灯,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion145_1"]="越南中秋的活动有较多与动物有关",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion146"]="日本的中秋节又称<color=#F2C730FF>十六夜</color>,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion146_1"]="日本的中秋节又称十五夜",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion147"]="日本的中秋节又称<color=#F2C730FF>芋阴月</color>,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion147_1"]="日本的中秋节又称芋明月",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion148"]="日本的中秋以吃<color=#F2C730FF>月见团子</color>为习俗,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion149"]="<color=#F2C730FF>韩国</color>的赏月活动称为“月见”,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion149_1"]="“月见”是日本的赏月活动",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion150"]="日本中秋节赏月时，会在<color=#F2C730FF>庭院</color>陈列团子、芒草等物品,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion150_1"]="“月见”时陈列物是放在室内的",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion151"]="中秋节对马来西亚来说是<color=#F2C730FF>只是舶来</color>的节日,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion151_1"]="马来西亚的中秋节是非常重要的传统节日",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion152"]="嫦娥吃仙药飞升是经过代代相传<color=#F2C730FF>改编</color>而成的,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion153"]="玉兔捣药最早见于屈原<color=#F2C730FF>《离骚》</color>,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion153_1"]="玉兔捣药最早出自屈原《天问》",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion154"]="传说中，玉兔和嫦娥<color=#F2C730FF>没有关系</color>，是分别登上月宫的,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion154_1"]="玉兔就是嫦娥所养的兔子，飞升时也同样带上了月宫",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion155"]="在<color=#F2C730FF>日本神话</color>中，玉兔不是在捣制长生不老药,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion156"]="著名乐曲《霓裳羽衣曲》与<color=#F2C730FF>唐太宗</color>梦游月宫有关,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion157"]="月饼曾在<color=#F2C730FF>宋代</color>为起义传递情报,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion157_1"]="月饼曾在元代为起义传递情报",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion158"]="歇后语八月十五的月亮——<color=#F2C730FF>正大</color>,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion159"]="歇后语八月十五吃年糕——<color=#F2C730FF>还早</color>,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion160"]="歇后语八月十五看灯笼——<color=#F2C730FF>迟了大半年</color>,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion161"]="歇后语八月十五过年——<color=#F2C730FF>差了节气</color>,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion162"]="有些地方中秋有偷吃习俗，<color=#F2C730FF>被偷吃的越多</color>，主人越高兴,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion163"]="播撒蜡液庆祝的煲蜡，<color=#F2C730FF>现在已经被禁止</color>,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion164"]="朝鲜半岛的秋夕<color=#F2C730FF>仅有庆祝秋收之意</color>,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion164_1"]="除庆祝秋收，朝鲜半岛的秋夕还有庆祝战胜渤海国之意",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion165"]="强羌水越来，是一种庆祝<color=#F2C730FF>中秋节</color>的民族舞蹈,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion166"]="除了中秋节之外，“月见”也可指<color=#F2C730FF>十月十三日</color>的夜晚,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion166_1"]="除了中秋节之外，“月见”也可指九月十三日的夜晚",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion167"]="中秋又有<color=#F2C730FF>“日光诞”</color>之别称,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion167_1"]="中秋又有“月光诞”的别称",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion168"]="<color=#F2C730FF>望月</color>为单身男女为求良缘，向月老祭拜的习俗,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion168_1"]="这个活动名叫乞月",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion169"]="观潮也是中秋一大习俗，主要集中在<color=#F2C730FF>浙江</color>,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion170"]="照月为<color=#F2C730FF>未生育女子</color>祈求子嗣，夜间沐浴月光的习俗,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion171"]="烧斗香是<color=#F2C730FF>中国北方</color>的中秋习俗,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion171_1"]="烧斗香是中国江苏的中秋习俗",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion172"]="“偷月亮菜”是一种中秋习俗，年轻女子趁夜色偷菜，意图<color=#F2C730FF>招财进宝</color>,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion172_1"]="“偷月亮菜”意图求段好姻缘",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion173"]="抛帕招亲源于中国福建地区，让未婚姑娘扮<color=#F2C730FF>玉兔</color>，抛手帕招亲,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion173_1"]="抛帕招亲源于中国福建地区，让未婚姑娘扮成嫦娥",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion174"]="吴刚是<color=#F2C730FF>受罚</color>留在月亮上，砍伐桂树的,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion175"]="“打月亮”是<color=#F2C730FF>藏族</color>习俗，人们舀水映月，并用石头击打倒影,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion175_1"]="“打月亮”是土族习俗",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion176"]="兔爷和玉兔是两个<color=#F2C730FF>不同</color>的人物,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion176_1"]="兔爷就是玉兔",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion177"]="中秋舞龙源于<color=#F2C730FF>蛟龙</color>作害的传说,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion177_1"]="中秋舞龙的习俗源自蟒蛇作害的传说",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion178"]="兔爷受嫦娥所托降世治病，却<color=#F2C730FF>不要任何酬劳</color>,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion179"]="中秋节烧塔的习俗，源于旧时<color=#F2C730FF>兵变</color>,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion179_1"]="中秋节烧塔的习俗，源于旧时农民起义",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion180"]="琉球中秋时，月饼，吹上饼<color=#F2C730FF>既可以食用，也可作祭品</color>,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion181"]="中秋仅祭拜月亮，属于一种<color=#F2C730FF>天象节</color>,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion181_1"]="中秋节不仅祭拜月亮，同时祭拜土地神，也属于丰收节",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion182"]="八月十五种麦——<color=#F2C730FF>太早了</color>,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion183"]="中秋的天气——<color=#F2C730FF>不冷不热</color>,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion184"]="八月十五套年磨——<color=#F2C730FF>早点</color>,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion185"]="八月十五吃饺子——<color=#F2C730FF>破了规矩</color>,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion186"]="八月十五打兔子——<color=#F2C730FF>差远了</color>,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion187"]="八月十五种花生——<color=#F2C730FF>瞎指挥</color>,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion188"]="站在河岸捞月亮——<color=#F2C730FF>白搭</color>,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion189"]="月亮追太阳——<color=#F2C730FF>老不碰头</color>,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion190"]="八月十五云遮月——<color=#F2C730FF>扫兴</color>,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion191"]="八月十五面朝火——<color=#F2C730FF>渐渐冷了</color>,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion192"]="八月十五种豆子——<color=#F2C730FF>晚了三秋</color>,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion193"]="八月十五团圆饼——<color=#F2C730FF>不给外人</color>,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion194"]="嫦娥用剪刀——<color=#F2C730FF>高裁（才）</color>,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion195"]="竹竿打月亮——<color=#F2C730FF>挨不上</color>,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion196"]="太阳和月亮讲话——<color=#F2C730FF>空谈</color>,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion197"]="疯狗咬月亮——<color=#F2C730FF>狂汪（妄）</color>,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion198"]="秃子追月亮——<color=#F2C730FF>沾光</color>,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion199"]="月亮下点灯——<color=#F2C730FF>多此一举</color>,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
    ["OXMidAutumnQuestion200"]="月亮下面耍弯刀——<color=#F2C730FF>明砍</color>,对<color=#64b4ff>（O）</color>或错<color=#ff6481>（X）</color>？",
