    ["WeaponSelectionTips01"]="<color=#ffd9db>移动快、能抗拉怪、控制</color>",
    ["WeaponSelectionTips02"]="<color=#ffd9db>攻速快、CD短、支援</color>",
    ["WeaponSelectionTips03"]="<color=#ffd9db>CD长、combo输出、输出</color>",
    ["WeaponSelectionTips04"]="<color=#ffedc9>驱散、施加损益效果</color>",
    ["WeaponSelectionTips05"]="<color=#ffedc9>近战输出、能抗、能恢复</color>",
    ["WeaponSelectionTips06"]="<color=#ffedc9>施加各种增益效果</color>",
